{
  "title": "Cisco Jina \u2014 Keyword vs semantic",
  "description": "MATCH(legal) vs vendor-lock-in concepts on cisco-jina-corpus.",
  "tags": [
    "cisco",
    "jina",
    "workshop",
    "cisco-search-jina"
  ],
  "time_range": {
    "from": "now-7d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "options": {
    "use_margins": true,
    "sync_colors": true,
    "sync_cursor": true,
    "sync_tooltips": false,
    "hide_panel_titles": false,
    "auto_apply_filters": true,
    "hide_panel_borders": false
  },
  "query": {
    "expression": "",
    "language": "kql"
  },
  "filters": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": "md-hero",
      "type": "markdown",
      "grid": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 48,
        "h": 8
      },
      "config": {
        "content": "## Keyword vs semantic\n\n_Refreshed by **Workflows \u2192 Cisco Jina Workshop \u2014 Dashboard notes** (every 10 minutes)._\n\n**What you are looking at**\n- Metrics: corpus size vs `MATCH(content, \"legal\")` vs concept `vendor-lock-in`\n- Left table: keyword / OpenSearch-shaped ceiling \u2014 Umbrella e-discovery *legal hold* noise\n- Right table: semantic neighborhood \u2014 Acme stays; Umbrella drops\n- Bottom: top concepts across `cisco-jina-corpus`\n\n**Talking point:** same business question, two retrieval ceilings.\n",
        "settings": {
          "open_links_in_new_tab": true
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "kpi-docs",
      "type": "vis",
      "grid": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 16,
        "h": 5
      },
      "config": {
        "title": "",
        "type": "metric",
        "data_source": {
          "type": "esql",
          "query": "FROM cisco-jina-corpus\n| STATS corpus_docs = COUNT(*)"
        },
        "metrics": [
          {
            "type": "primary",
            "column": "corpus_docs"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "kpi-legal",
      "type": "vis",
      "grid": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 16,
        "h": 5
      },
      "config": {
        "title": "",
        "type": "metric",
        "data_source": {
          "type": "esql",
          "query": "FROM cisco-jina-corpus\n| WHERE MATCH(content, \"legal\")\n| STATS legal_hits = COUNT(*)"
        },
        "metrics": [
          {
            "type": "primary",
            "column": "legal_hits"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "kpi-lockin",
      "type": "vis",
      "grid": {
        "x": 32,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 16,
        "h": 5
      },
      "config": {
        "title": "",
        "type": "metric",
        "data_source": {
          "type": "esql",
          "query": "FROM cisco-jina-corpus\n| MV_EXPAND concepts\n| WHERE concepts == \"vendor-lock-in\"\n| STATS lockin_hits = COUNT(*)"
        },
        "metrics": [
          {
            "type": "primary",
            "column": "lockin_hits"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "kw-legal-table",
      "type": "vis",
      "grid": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 12
      },
      "config": {
        "title": "Keyword MATCH(legal) by account",
        "type": "data_table",
        "data_source": {
          "type": "esql",
          "query": "FROM cisco-jina-corpus\n| WHERE MATCH(content, \"legal\")\n| STATS hits = COUNT(*) BY account\n| SORT hits DESC"
        },
        "sampling": 1,
        "ignore_global_filters": false,
        "rows": [
          {
            "column": "account"
          },
          {
            "column": "hits"
          }
        ],
        "styling": {
          "paging": 10
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sem-lockin-table",
      "type": "vis",
      "grid": {
        "x": 24,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 12
      },
      "config": {
        "title": "Concept vendor-lock-in by account",
        "type": "data_table",
        "data_source": {
          "type": "esql",
          "query": "FROM cisco-jina-corpus\n| MV_EXPAND concepts\n| WHERE concepts == \"vendor-lock-in\"\n| STATS hits = COUNT(*) BY account\n| SORT hits DESC"
        },
        "sampling": 1,
        "ignore_global_filters": false,
        "rows": [
          {
            "column": "account"
          },
          {
            "column": "hits"
          }
        ],
        "styling": {
          "paging": 10
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "concepts-bar",
      "type": "vis",
      "grid": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 25,
        "w": 48,
        "h": 12
      },
      "config": {
        "title": "Top concepts across corpus",
        "type": "xy",
        "axis": {
          "x": {
            "title": {
              "visible": false
            }
          },
          "y": {
            "title": {
              "visible": false
            }
          }
        },
        "layers": [
          {
            "type": "bar_horizontal",
            "data_source": {
              "type": "esql",
              "query": "FROM cisco-jina-corpus\n| MV_EXPAND concepts\n| STATS docs = COUNT(*) BY concepts\n| SORT docs DESC\n| LIMIT 12"
            },
            "x": {
              "column": "concepts"
            },
            "y": [
              {
                "column": "docs"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
